<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <style>
        /* Global Styles */
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(136, 6, 249, 0.8), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)), url("background3.jpg");
            background-size: cover;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #fff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8505db 0%, #395ded 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        /* Navbar */
        /* Navbar */
.navbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);        padding: 20px 40px;
}

/* Search Bar */
.search-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: auto; /* Align search bar to the right */
}

.search-bar input {
    padding: 10px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 20px;
    outline: none;
    width: 200px;
    transition: width 0.3s ease-in-out;
}

.search-bar input:focus {
    width: 300px;
}

.search-bar button {
    background: #fa0254;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    margin-left: 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.search-bar button:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    background: #1c1114;
}

        /* Search Bar */
        .form-inline {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .form-inline .form-control {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-right: 20px;
            font-size: 1.5rem; /* Increased font size */
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            width: 300px; /* Adjust the width to fit the design */
        }

        .form-inline .form-control:focus {
            outline: none;
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }

        .form-inline .btn {
            border-radius: 50px;
            background-color: #ff6f61;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.5rem; /* Increased font size */
            padding: 15px 30px; /* Increased padding for bigger size */
            border: none;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .form-inline .btn:hover {
            background-color: #ff3b2f;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        /* Heading */
        h1 {
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-shadow: 5px 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            margin-top: 60px;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-out;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
            }

            100% {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

                /* Content Container */
.content-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 40px 0;
    animation: fadeIn 2s ease-out;
    width: 100%;
}

/* Video Container */
.video {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1000px; /* Maximum size */
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; /* Ensures aspect ratio is preserved */
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

/* Video */
.video iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    max-width: 100%; /* Ensures the iframe scales correctly */
    max-height: 100%; /* Ensures the iframe scales correctly */
}

/* Hover effect for video container */
.video:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0px 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
}

        .container1,
        .container2,
        .video {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0px 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            text-align: center;
            width: 30%;
            max-width: 480px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .container1 img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }

        .container2 p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #d1d1d1;
            animation: slideIn 1s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(30px);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

  

        .container1:hover,
        .container2:hover,
        .video:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0px 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }

        /* Want-to-Go Button Style */
        .wanttogo button {
            background-color: #ffac41;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0px 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .wanttogo button:hover {
            background-color: #ff8c00;
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0px 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        /* Scroll Effects */
        .scroll-section {
            position: relative;
            padding: 50px 0;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        }

        .scroll-section h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #ffac41;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Full-Screen Video */
        .fullscreen-video-container {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            z-index: -1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .fullscreen-video-container video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        /* Mobile Responsiveness */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .container1,
            .container2,
            .video {
                width: 90%;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }

            .navbar-brand {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .form-inline {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                margin-top: 20px;
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
        /* Return to Home Button */
        .return-home {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

       
        .return-home button {
            background-color: #e90966;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0px 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .return-home button:hover {
            background-color: #0f0c0a;
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0px 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .custom-link {
            color: #ffac41; /* Change to any color you like */
            text-decoration: none; /* Removes underline */
            font-weight: bold; /* Optional, adds bold text */
        }
        
        .custom-link:hover {
            color: #f39c12; /* Color on hover */
            text-decoration: underline; /* Optional, adds underline on hover */
        }
      


    </style>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>Annapurna</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>


   <!-- Return to Home Button -->
   <div class="return-home">
    <button onclick="window.location.href='/home'" class="navbar-toggler">Return to Home</button>
</div>

<div class="navbar">

    <div class="search-bar">
        <form method="POST" action="/search">
            <input type="text" name="Search" placeholder="Search here..." />
            <button type="submit">Search</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h1>Explore the Magic of Annapurna</h1>

    <!-- Content Section -->
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="container1">
            <img src="/annapurna.png" alt="Annapurna Image">
        </div>
        <div class="container2">
            <p>Annapurna Circuit has been voted as the best long-distance trek in the world, as it combined a wide variety of climate zones from tropics at 600m above sea level to the arctic at 5416m above sea level at the Thorong La pass and cultural variety from Hindu villages at the low foothills to the Tibetan culture of Manang.
            .</p>
        </div>

        <div class="video">
            <iframe width="500" height="500" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vG_Ck5bTOnY" 
            title="Exploring Paris, France | Iconic Landmarks & Parisian Charm #paris #france #travel #discover #europe" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        
            <!-- Fallback content -->
            <noscript>
                <p>Sorry, we cannot load the video at the moment. Please ensure JavaScript is enabled or check back later.</p>
                <p>If you wish, you can also view the video on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vG_Ck5bTOnY" target="_blank">YouTube</a>.</p>
            </noscript>
        
            <!-- Alternative content in case the iframe does not load -->
            <div class="fallback-content">
                <p>Sorry, if the video could not be loaded. You can watch it on YouTube: 
                    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vG_Ck5bTOnY" target="_blank" class="custom-link">Watch on YouTube</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

       
    </div>

    <!-- Want-to-Go List Button -->
    <div class="wanttogo">
        <form method="POST" action="/add-to-wanttogo">
            <input type="hidden" name="destination" value="annapurna">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Add to Want-to-Go</button>
        </form>
        <div class="message-container">
            <% if (message && message.trim() !== '') { %>
                <p><%= message %></p>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>